<p>Normocytic anemia: chronic disease, acute blood loss&#x000a0;<xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-27376.r64">[64]</xref><xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-27376.r65">[65]</xref><xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-27376.r66">[66]</xref>&#x000a0;</p>
